From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate 0364-lichii-cpu-0234-skip-repeated-index-binds.patch

Source: 0364-lichii-cpu-0234-skip-repeated-index-binds.patch
Core patch. Paths are the submodule's. Applies on core16 alone or in the lichii-cpu order.

Source: zortos293/Lichii PR 161, commit 5a0cdcbeef, and PR 184, commit 440f0c2ac4, GPL-3.0-or-later.
PR 161 was still open on 6 Nov; PR 184 is merged.

EDEN_NX2_INDEX_REBIND=0: BindIndexBuffer returns when buffer, offset and type match the last bind and
the scheduler's recording epoch has not moved. The epoch moves at InvalidateState and at the end of
a render pass. BindQuadIndexBuffer clears the memory of it. Unset, every draw binds as before.

Small: one Record and one vkCmdBindIndexBuffer per skipped draw.

Pool memory: none.

Checked: PS5-target syntax compile of the derived vk_buffer_cache_cost.cpp and vulkan_scheduler.cpp,
0 errors. Every other vkCmdBindIndexBuffer runs through BindQuadIndexBuffer. Not run.

diff --git a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_buffer_cache.cpp b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_buffer_cache.cpp
index 78a5653e65..ffc1b47445 100644
--- a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_buffer_cache.cpp
+++ b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_buffer_cache.cpp
@@ -705,12 +705,32 @@ void BufferCacheRuntime::BindIndexBuffer(PrimitiveTopology topology, IndexFormat
         ReserveNullBuffer();
         vk_buffer = *null_buffer;
     }
+    // EDEN_NX2_INDEX_REBIND=0: the same index buffer is still bound in this command buffer, so
+    // skip the rebind. Lichii PR 161, commit 5a0cdcbeef.
+    static const bool skip_rebind = [] {
+        const char* value = std::getenv("EDEN_NX2_INDEX_REBIND");
+        return value != nullptr && value[0] == '0';
+    }();
+    if (skip_rebind) {
+        const u64 epoch = scheduler.RecordingEpoch();
+        if (bound_index_valid && vk_buffer == bound_index_buffer &&
+            vk_offset == bound_index_offset && vk_index_type == bound_index_type &&
+            epoch == bound_index_epoch) {
+            return;
+        }
+        bound_index_valid = true;
+        bound_index_buffer = vk_buffer;
+        bound_index_offset = vk_offset;
+        bound_index_type = vk_index_type;
+        bound_index_epoch = epoch;
+    }
     scheduler.Record([vk_buffer, vk_offset, vk_index_type](vk::CommandBuffer cmdbuf) {
         cmdbuf.BindIndexBuffer(vk_buffer, vk_offset, vk_index_type);
     });
 }
 
 void BufferCacheRuntime::BindQuadIndexBuffer(PrimitiveTopology topology, u32 first, u32 count) {
+    bound_index_valid = false;
     if (count == 0) {
         ReserveNullBuffer();
         scheduler.Record([this](vk::CommandBuffer cmdbuf) {
